  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Current Issues in Transfer Pricing Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This was a 3-day live online tailored course for the TRA, which took place between 10 to 12 May 2022. The days were divided between hybrid live sessions and case study discussions. The topics discussed included, Understanding Tax Effective Value Chains in Multinational Groups, Intra-Group Services and Case Studies, Transfer Pricing and Intangibles, Intra-Group Finance Transactions, Business Restructuring, Permanent Establishments, Attribution of Profits to Permanent Establishments, among others.</narrative>
  </description>
